right, long-lasting</p>\n<div class=\"stat-value\">$1,299</div>\n<div class=\"small\">★ 4.6 <span class=\"muted\">· 1,840 reviews</span></div>\n<p class=\"small\"><strong>Best for:</strong> Travel and everyday work</p>\n<div class=\"hr\"></div>\n<div class=\"small up\">+ Gorgeous OLED panel<br>+ Great battery<br>+ Quiet under load</div>\n<div class=\"small down\">− Soldered RAM<br>− Glossy screen</div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-block\">Choose Aero 14</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card stack gap-sm lap\" data-n=\"forge\">\n<div class=\"between\"><h3 class=\"h3\">Forge 16</h3><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Most powerful</span></div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Desktop power on the go</p>\n<div class=\"stat-value\">$1,899</div>\n<div class=\"small\">★ 4.4 <span class=\"muted\">· 960 reviews</span></div>\n<p class=\"small\"><strong>Best for:</strong> Video editing, 3D and gaming</p>\n<div class=\"hr\"></div>\n<div class=\"small up\">+ Fastest of the three<br>+ Upgradeable RAM and SSD<br>+ Full port selection</div>\n<div class=\"small down\">− Heavy<br>− Fans are audible</div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-block\">Choose Forge 16</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card stack gap-sm lap\" data-n=\"nimbus\">\n<div class=\"between\"><h3 class=\"h3\">Nimbus 13</h3><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Best value</span></div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Everything you need, for less</p>\n<div class=\"stat-value\">$999</div>\n<div class=\"small\">★ 4.2 <span class=\"muted\">· 2,310 reviews</span></div>\n<p class=\"small\"><strong>Best for:</strong> Students and light office work</p>\n<div class=\"hr\"></div>\n<div class=\"small up\">+ Lightest<br>+ Best battery life<br>+ Lowest price</div>\n<div class=\"small down\">− Dimmer screen<br>− Small SSD</div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-block\">Choose Nimbus 13</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n<div class=\"between\"><div class=\"card-title\">Spec sheet</div><label class=\"check small\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"diff\"> Sho